Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.83,0:15:20.77,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\c&H4E3A9F&\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(516,30)}淺野學峯\N{\c&H000000&}應切腹自盡下{\c&H4E3A9F&}地獄\N{\c&H4E3A9F&}受火刑 {\c&H000000&}因為他{\c&H4E3A9F&}霸道
